WEBVTT

00:04.230 --> 00:05.580
Forgive me!

00:29.960 --> 00:32.920
Ha! So that's all for you, executioner.

00:48.250 --> 00:50.610
Y-You monster...

01:17.640 --> 01:21.180
<i>My tears scattered like bits of paper</i>

01:21.180 --> 01:24.890
<i>Scared of the unknowable tomorrow</i>

01:24.890 --> 01:28.410
<i>I lived the same day over and over,
 back and forth</i>

01:28.410 --> 01:32.240
<i>But a new morning never came</i>

01:32.240 --> 01:34.490
<i>All the reasons to calm down</i>

01:34.490 --> 01:38.920
<i>Are just some moments until the crash</i>

01:39.440 --> 01:42.420
<i>I'm no longer the one that everyone knows</i>

01:42.420 --> 01:46.720
<i>Took off the fragile armor</i>

01:46.720 --> 01:53.790
<i>I don't want to lose any more love</i>

01:54.210 --> 02:01.270
<i>I don't want to lose any more love</i>

02:01.270 --> 02:04.960
<i>There's still no line 
between today and tomorrow</i>

02:04.960 --> 02:08.530
<i>My waking nightmare doesn't end</i>

02:08.530 --> 02:12.160
<i>And yet I won't lose hope</i>

02:12.160 --> 02:18.210
<i>And yet there's no night that doesn't end</i>

02:18.210 --> 02:30.550
<i>Not here, not here</i>

02:33.380 --> 02:36.610
<i>The authorities have not yet 
been able to track down</i>

02:36.610 --> 02:39.580
<i>the plant thief terrorizing the region.</i>

02:39.580 --> 02:43.510
<i>Even red plants scheduled 
for disposal are being taken,</i>

02:43.510 --> 02:48.020
<i>suggesting the culprit behind the spree
isn't well-versed in plant technology.</i>

02:45.830 --> 02:48.020
You guys fight over candy or something?

02:48.020 --> 02:52.930
<i>The JuLai government continues
its search for the key witnesses.</i>

02:52.930 --> 02:54.520
<i>The man named Vash—</i>

02:55.480 --> 03:01.580
You can take the Sand Steamer from
 the port up ahead to get to JuLai.

03:02.380 --> 03:04.320
Are we leaving the car behind?

03:05.610 --> 03:07.540
This is where we check out.

03:07.540 --> 03:08.750
What?

03:08.750 --> 03:12.870
We need to return to headquarters. 
Gotta write up our article.

03:12.870 --> 03:13.460
But...

03:13.460 --> 03:15.340
You're fine with that, right?

03:22.050 --> 03:25.990
<i>Last call for boarding.</i>

03:26.490 --> 03:30.840
<i>All passengers, please complete
 boarding procedures</i>

03:30.840 --> 03:33.230
<i>and head to the boarding gate.</i>

03:33.770 --> 03:36.230
<i>If you have not yet completed
 boarding procedures,</i>

03:36.230 --> 03:39.280
<i>please speak to an attendant immediately.</i>

03:39.280 --> 03:43.940
<i>Thank you for your cooperation
in keeping us on schedule.</i>

03:43.940 --> 03:46.660
I though you guys were buddies.

03:43.940 --> 03:48.420
<i>Please note that this is both
 a cargo and passenger ship.</i>

03:46.660 --> 03:47.790
No way.

03:47.790 --> 03:50.250
No? How cold.

03:48.420 --> 03:54.490
<i>Thank you for traveling 
via Sand Steamer today.</i>

03:50.890 --> 03:52.280
I don't understand!

03:53.030 --> 03:54.490
Didn't think you would.

03:54.490 --> 03:57.630
How can we let the 
Humanoid Typhoon get away?

03:57.630 --> 04:00.050
He's too much trouble.

04:00.050 --> 04:03.480
What kind of monster looks 
the same for twenty years?

04:03.480 --> 04:04.510
Are you scared?

04:05.140 --> 04:06.490
Say what you will.

04:06.490 --> 04:10.090
We're writing for a tabloid. 
Nothing worth risking our lives over.

04:14.890 --> 04:17.620
Then it's okay if we're <i>not</i> risking our lives?

04:19.230 --> 04:21.160
You're such a...

04:33.290 --> 04:35.400
<i>Thank you for boarding the Humpback,</i>

04:35.400 --> 04:41.210
<i>bound to cross the Great Sand Ocean.</i>

04:41.210 --> 04:45.590
<i>This ship is one of the largest 
Sand Steamers on Noman's Land.</i>

04:46.140 --> 04:49.060
<i>Our plant is one of the 
most powerful in the world,</i>

04:49.060 --> 04:53.380
<i>meaning safety and peace of mind
 for our passengers.</i>

04:53.380 --> 04:58.580
<i>Our destination is the third city of JuLai 
on the other side of the Great Sand Ocean.</i>

04:58.580 --> 05:02.780
<i>Please sit back and enjoy the voyage.</i>

05:14.540 --> 05:16.290
What's your endgame?

05:16.290 --> 05:17.690
Huh?

05:17.690 --> 05:19.460
You're following me around.

05:19.460 --> 05:21.580
I'm your babysitter.

05:21.580 --> 05:24.520
You're a spoiled brat 
who can't even kill bad guys.

05:27.190 --> 05:28.970
You should be thanking me.

05:31.390 --> 05:34.060
You don't get to choose who lives and dies.

05:34.060 --> 05:37.200
Still going on about that?

05:36.710 --> 05:37.910
Let's have tea over there.

05:37.910 --> 05:39.060
Sure.

05:38.220 --> 05:42.440
Don't you have something you want 
to protect more than anything else, too?

05:43.920 --> 05:45.570
Enough already.

05:45.950 --> 05:50.910
The only reason you've survived this long 
is because other people died instead.

05:50.910 --> 05:54.580
That's not what I mean, and you know it.

05:54.580 --> 05:57.500
What? I don't get you at all.

05:58.010 --> 06:00.130
All I hear is more talk.

06:03.340 --> 06:07.800
If you can't even wipe your own ass, 
any point you try to make is...

06:14.680 --> 06:16.180
Run, Needle-noggin!

06:49.390 --> 06:50.700
What gives?

06:52.600 --> 06:54.470
What are you doing here...

06:59.940 --> 07:03.940
#06 Once Upon a Time in Hopeland

07:01.030 --> 07:02.200
Livio?

07:16.950 --> 07:19.960
Everyone! Here's a new friend!

07:30.220 --> 07:32.720
His name is Livio.

07:41.730 --> 07:44.230
Mommy... Daddy...

07:56.740 --> 07:59.750
Oh, here you are.

08:32.110 --> 08:34.740
The name's Nicholas D. Wolfwood.

08:49.420 --> 08:52.420
You're finally smiling, crybaby Livio.

09:09.480 --> 09:11.690
What are you brats doing?!

09:40.360 --> 09:42.680
Stop, Livio! Don't kill him!

09:51.250 --> 09:52.470
Is this the reported location?

09:52.470 --> 09:53.280
Don't move!

09:53.280 --> 09:54.260
Drop your weapon!

09:54.260 --> 09:56.860
What are you doing?! 
Resist and we'll shoot!

09:56.860 --> 09:58.280
Don't come over here!

10:03.290 --> 10:05.500
Hey! You, too! Drop your weapons!

10:06.080 --> 10:07.250
What are you doing?!

10:07.900 --> 10:09.160
Answer me!

10:17.670 --> 10:19.710
Wh-Wh-Whoa! Watch it!

10:19.710 --> 10:22.340
You trying to get fired in your first year?

10:22.340 --> 10:23.340
I get it.

10:23.340 --> 10:25.360
The repair costs alone would—

10:25.360 --> 10:27.450
I get it. I'll drive safely.

10:27.450 --> 10:31.120
No, you don't. I'm saying to let this go.

10:31.120 --> 10:32.310
I get it.

10:33.310 --> 10:36.580
Fine! Just remember that 
this is an undercover report.

10:36.580 --> 10:37.970
I get it!

10:37.970 --> 10:40.180
Pull out at the first sign 
of trouble, you hear?

10:40.180 --> 10:41.760
I get it!

10:41.760 --> 10:44.150
Do you <i>really?</i>

10:46.990 --> 10:50.510
Man, this is just the worst.

11:19.610 --> 11:22.110
You must be Nicholas.

11:23.570 --> 11:26.330
You've passed the selection test.

11:32.460 --> 11:34.840
Congratulations, child of blessing.

12:12.500 --> 12:16.210
Test Subject HL1-06   Chemical Aptitude: S+

12:29.680 --> 12:34.390
In addition to repairing 
any damage done to your body,

12:34.390 --> 12:36.960
this drug rebuilds and 
strengthens your cells.

12:39.170 --> 12:42.270
It can heal any wound.

12:46.010 --> 12:47.780
Sounds like a dream, right?

12:52.790 --> 12:55.480
<i>Nico! Nico!</i>

12:55.980 --> 12:59.000
<i>Nico! Nico!</i>

13:08.250 --> 13:13.230
The accelerated growth
 comes at a price, but...

13:16.640 --> 13:19.520
He's grown so much in just a few months.

13:19.520 --> 13:22.250
An unavoidable side effect.

13:22.250 --> 13:23.650
How terrible...

13:23.650 --> 13:25.060
What a monster.

13:40.370 --> 13:41.470
We've got a runner!

13:42.540 --> 13:43.300
Is that...

13:47.100 --> 13:48.520
Hey! Don't move!

13:49.280 --> 13:50.150
Hold it!

13:52.790 --> 13:53.880
Stop!

13:55.610 --> 13:57.100
What are you doing?!

13:57.100 --> 13:59.230
Don't hurt him! He's a test subject!

14:13.460 --> 14:15.040
How splendid...

14:27.510 --> 14:30.440
I'm going back to the orphanage!

14:52.260 --> 14:54.660
How is he maintaining his own will?

14:57.580 --> 14:59.410
S+ boy...

15:01.670 --> 15:03.420
You have a gift.

15:04.060 --> 15:08.060
Starting today, you shall join 
the Eye of Michael.

15:13.160 --> 15:18.140
I'm sure you'll like it. 
We worship a beautiful angel.

15:21.130 --> 15:23.100
I don't believe in any god.

15:23.580 --> 15:25.100
Punishment...

15:25.950 --> 15:32.170
You will eliminate all abnormalities 
in Master Knives's noble plan.

15:33.410 --> 15:34.840
Rebels.

15:38.060 --> 15:39.120
Fugitives.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.610
Losers.

15:44.880 --> 15:46.960
What a gross religion.

15:46.960 --> 15:48.360
I'm sure you'll like it.

15:48.360 --> 15:50.900
That's a hard pass from me, idiot!

15:56.090 --> 15:57.680
This is your little brother, no?

15:58.520 --> 15:59.700
Livio...

16:00.430 --> 16:03.780
I hear he volunteered himself
to follow after you.

16:04.550 --> 16:06.800
What beautiful fraternal love.

16:07.920 --> 16:12.320
If you won't join us, he says 
he'll work for us instead.

16:12.320 --> 16:13.570
So what will it be?

16:14.700 --> 16:17.320
Damn you and your freaky blue hair!

16:25.130 --> 16:27.630
Don't talk about my hair.

16:32.290 --> 16:37.600
It's futile. My power isn't mere 
nerve control or electrical impulse.

16:40.010 --> 16:43.020
Livio... R-Run!

16:45.990 --> 16:50.820
Love, attachment... I simply don't get it.

16:51.550 --> 16:53.340
There's no need for emotion.

16:53.870 --> 16:56.780
Sacrifice everything to devotion,
 body and spirit.

16:57.320 --> 16:58.180
Now come.

16:58.180 --> 17:02.430
No way, you creepy blue freak!

17:08.500 --> 17:09.950
Bluesummers!

17:11.620 --> 17:13.420
Oh. You're here already.

17:13.420 --> 17:15.450
Please be gentle with him.

17:15.450 --> 17:17.460
He's just a stray.

17:17.460 --> 17:21.790
He has S+ drug compatibility,
 the highest class.

17:23.570 --> 17:25.690
Oh, dear, I'm so sorry...

17:26.310 --> 17:28.270
Priest William.

17:29.690 --> 17:31.730
You mustn't defile life!

17:32.810 --> 17:35.060
Forgive us, boy.

17:41.210 --> 17:44.330
I'm sorry, Livio...

17:48.710 --> 17:52.550
Please! Don't make me kill you!

18:00.140 --> 18:01.880
There he is! Fire!

18:07.550 --> 18:08.920
Fire!

18:16.070 --> 18:18.180
He's still alive? But how?

18:20.510 --> 18:22.210
Without the meds?

18:28.060 --> 18:28.960
Who is that guy?!

18:28.960 --> 18:30.560
None of your business!

18:30.560 --> 18:32.580
Hurry and hide before he finds you.

18:32.580 --> 18:33.770
Someone's gonna get killed!

18:33.770 --> 18:35.730
You shouldn't be worrying about other people!

18:35.730 --> 18:38.340
You know him, don't you?!
You have to help him!

18:39.140 --> 18:40.500
It's too late.

18:49.220 --> 18:51.080
Hey! Don't go, Needle-noggin!

18:51.080 --> 18:53.260
Stop this! It's me you want, right?!

19:05.820 --> 19:07.440
I have to catch up...

19:09.500 --> 19:11.040
Drop your weapons and surrender!

19:11.040 --> 19:14.210
Listen, you soldiers need to run!

19:14.210 --> 19:15.470
Engaged on the lower deck.

19:15.470 --> 19:16.990
Need backup immediately.

19:16.990 --> 19:18.190
Put your hands up!

19:20.550 --> 19:22.470
Idiots should stand back!

19:24.260 --> 19:25.500
Wolfwood?!

19:37.230 --> 19:40.360
I told you to stand back, Needle-noggin!

19:41.190 --> 19:43.870
I can't let you two kill each other!

19:48.590 --> 19:50.960
The Punisher is in a bit of a bind, it seems!

19:56.080 --> 19:58.580
It is indeed a tough choice.

19:59.460 --> 20:03.700
If his brother dies, other children 
at the orphanage will be next...

20:04.420 --> 20:06.890
until they find one 
with good drug compatibility.

20:06.890 --> 20:09.220
Humans have such bad taste.

20:10.170 --> 20:13.040
He's purely trying to protect too much.

20:14.590 --> 20:16.840
Damn it!

20:20.070 --> 20:21.730
Just hide already!

20:21.730 --> 20:22.410
But—

20:22.410 --> 20:23.700
I'll beat your ass myself!

20:23.700 --> 20:26.070
<i>We are currently assessing the situation.</i>

20:26.070 --> 20:28.250
<i>Please follow the attendants' instructions.</i>

20:28.250 --> 20:30.060
<i>Emergency deployment in progress.</i>

20:28.580 --> 20:30.060
Hurry!

20:36.710 --> 20:38.840
There's no need for emotion.

20:39.630 --> 20:44.340
Love, attachment... I simply don't get it.

20:45.320 --> 20:48.360
Still can't give up on your little brother?

20:49.810 --> 20:52.630
Shouldn't you just accept reality already?

21:17.610 --> 21:20.210
The ship's going off course?

21:28.700 --> 21:31.350
All that glitters is ours!

21:29.530 --> 21:32.520
The most gorgeous and terrifying
 bandits you'll ever see!

21:32.520 --> 21:33.350
Here we go!

21:33.350 --> 21:36.160
Raiders of the desert!

21:36.850 --> 21:39.090
Go, go, go!

21:39.820 --> 21:43.860
The Bad Lads Gang? Now of all times?

21:47.640 --> 21:50.780
So... what's your next move, Punisher?

21:53.160 --> 21:54.870
Who will you kill?

21:58.240 --> 21:59.910
Who will you save?

22:09.790 --> 22:13.460
I've got you.

22:19.980 --> 22:27.600
<i>Your light...</i>

22:34.060 --> 22:38.360
<i>If that light never changes</i>

22:38.360 --> 22:42.790
<i>And continues to shine high above the sky</i>

22:42.790 --> 22:47.100
<i>Even when I'm lost, 
even when I'm struggling</i>

22:47.100 --> 22:51.350
<i>I'll continue to search for you</i>

22:51.350 --> 22:55.640
<i>Even on days of sickness or sadness</i>

22:55.640 --> 23:00.020
<i>I'll open the window to a new morning</i>

23:00.020 --> 23:04.210
<i>I'm moving forward, I'm standing still</i>

23:04.210 --> 23:07.770
<i>Tell the people who are praying</i>

23:07.770 --> 23:13.730
<i>But today this flower 
before me is praising you</i>

23:13.730 --> 23:16.740
<i>My song is a song of joy and wishes</i>

23:16.740 --> 23:19.460
<i>Yes, I'm reaching out</i>

23:19.460 --> 23:24.800
<i>But you're too high up 
in the evening stars</i>

23:24.800 --> 23:30.770
<i>But today this flower 
before me is praising you</i>

23:30.770 --> 23:33.920
<i>My song is a song of joy and wishes</i>

23:33.920 --> 23:36.620
<i>Yes, I try to reach out</i>

23:36.620 --> 23:41.780
<i>But you're too high up 
in the evening stars</i>
